<!-- 游戏特色区域 -->
<section id="features" class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-900 to-black relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url(<%= url_for('images/bhcyl/bg03.png') %>)]"
            style="background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: contain;"    
        ></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 z-10 relative">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center text-ancient-gold mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
            游戏特色
        </h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <!-- 左侧图片 -->
            <div class="relative" data-aos="fade-right">
                <img src="<%- page.features.images[0] %>"
                     alt="Gameplay" 
                     class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-2xl border border-ancient-gold/30"
                >
            </div>
            
            <!-- 右侧特色列表 -->
            <div>
                <div class="space-y-8">
                    <div class="flex gap-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-ancient-gold/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border border-ancient-gold/30">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-dragon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ancient-gold mb-2">自由探索与御空飞行：高沉浸的开放修仙</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-300">
                                摒弃传统点击式操作，玩家需亲自操控角色御剑飞行，穿梭于水墨山水之间，手动开启传送点、对话 NPC、实时战斗，强化探索的真实感与操作乐趣。
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex gap-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-ancient-gold/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border border-ancient-gold/30">
                            <i class="fa fa-map text-ancient-gold text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ancient-gold mb-2">水墨国风美术：活的东方奇幻画卷</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-300">
                                原创世界观与主线剧情环环相扣，交织正魔对抗与爱恨纠葛，纯手绘水墨技法结合动态光影，营造空灵奇幻的仙侠意境。
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex gap-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-ancient-gold/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border border-ancient-gold/30">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-hands-asl-interpreting"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ancient-gold mb-2">轻松养成：无抽卡、低压力、高公平</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-300">
                                核心玩法为收集道友与功法，但无任何抽卡机制，所有资源通过日常任务、副本稳定获取，拒绝逼氪骗氪。
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex gap-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-ancient-gold/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border border-ancient-gold/30">
                            <i class="fa fa-magic text-ancient-gold text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ancient-gold mb-2">多元玩法</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-300">
                                游戏包含炼丹、炼器、灵兽、契灵等多种修仙系统，让玩家能够全方位体验修仙的乐趣。
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>